<div class="place">
  <h3>Theiriat Tlâng</h3>
  <p>⭐ 4.5/5 (67 reviews)</p>
  <p>VQ9Q+5F2 · 5.0 km</p>
  <p>Serene valley views, fresh air and mist. A popular spot for children and families. Open 24 hours.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Theiriat+Tlang+Lunglei" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<div class="place">
  <h3>View of Lunglei (Serkawn)</h3>
  <p>⭐ 4.6/5 (18 reviews)</p>
  <p>WQG2+J6G, Lunglei-Thenzawl Road</p>
  <p>Panoramic views of Lunglei town, surrounding hills, valleys and clouds.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=View+of+Lunglei+Serkawn" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<div class="place">
  <h3>Sairep Tlang</h3>
  <p>⭐ 4.4/5 (10 reviews)</p>
  <p>RR9C+9GF · 11.1 km</p>
  <p>A peaceful place known for beautiful hill scenery and responsible tourism.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sairep+Tlang+Lunglei" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<div class="place">
  <h3>Nghasih Stream &amp; Rock Bridge</h3>
  <p>A natural volcanic rock bridge across Nghasih Stream. A relaxing place to enjoy nature, greenery and swimming spots.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Nghasih+Stream+Rock+Bridge+Mizoram" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<h2>Wildlife Sanctuaries</h2>

<div class="place">
  <h3>Khawnglung Wildlife Sanctuary</h3>
  <p>Mizoram · 32.8 km</p>
  <p>Covers around 41 sq km of forest. Wildlife includes leopard, barking deer, sambar, serow, hoolock gibbon and wild boar.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Khawnglung+Wildlife+Sanctuary" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<div class="place">
  <h3>Thorangtlang Wildlife Sanctuary</h3>
  <p>Thenhlum, Mizoram · 45.9 km</p>
  <p>⭐ 3.0/5 (2 reviews)</p>
  <p>Around 50 sq km of evergreen forest. Home to elephants, leopards, gaur, deer, sloth bears, hoolock gibbons and birds.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Thorangtlang+Wildlife+Sanctuary" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

<div class="place">
  <h3>Saza Wildlife Sanctuary</h3>
  <p>A forest reserve known for birdwatching and wildlife such as barking deer, leopards and rhesus monkeys.</p>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Saza+Wildlife+Sanctuary+Mizoram" target="_blank">View Map</a>
</div>

